                                            <task type="Show Message Box" id="8" taskOnFail="false" >
                                                <data value="Droid Diagnosis" name="journalEntryTitle" />
                                                <data value="&quot;You connect the droid's chassis to the diagnostic terminal and power it on. After its analysis is complete, you sift through the diagnostic logs and search for anything out of the ordinary. You pull up the droid's logs and note that the communication packet that contained the virus was uploaded to the droid's mainframe through a direct connection established via a control terminal in the Mining Sector. Perhaps that's where Io is hiding. With the location of the control terminal in mind, you log off the terminal, discard the droid's chassis and head off to return to the Mining Sector.&quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
